Improper Input Validation and Command Injection The application accepts file uploads from untrusted sources and uses these files in a command-line operation without proper validation or sanitization, which could lead to command injection., Improper Resource Management Temporary files are stored on the server, and if not properly managed or deleted, this could lead to resource exhaustion or unauthorized access to sensitive data.

